Changes in this fork (2026, by kanzakivnw)
------------------------------------------

- Added `src/themes/shimo.js`: a built-in Shimo Docs theme with light and dark palettes and diagram / chart tokens.
- Made `shimo` the default theme in `src/config.js` (`auto` remains available).
- Renamed the skill, package, plugin and DSH provider identifiers to
  `answer-me-with-html-in-shimo-style`.
- Updated the install guide, README files and preview images.

